"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "速度限制、每個種子的連線數、上傳槽位和做種在新增種子時設定，或稍後在種子設定中修改。種子使用連線標籤頁中的代理（HTTP 或 SOCKS5，或透過“使用系統設定”使用 Mac 的代理）以及所有下載的速度限制。更改僅適用於之後開始的種子。節點和 Tracker 可以看到你的 IP 地址，或你的代理的地址。";
